#: ../../tools/clingen_ar_tools.rst:32 1b4c05e80cab4d4b8a8621b9de7ebb26
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed cross-references and external database "
"records for a ClinGen canonical allele. Takes a ClinGen allele ID (CA ID)"
" and returns links to ClinVar, dbSNP, COSMIC, gnomAD, ExAC, and other "
"databases. Useful for finding all known database entries for a given "
"variant. Example: CA000387 (TP53 R248Q) returns ClinVar variation IDs, "
"COSMIC IDs, dbSNP rsIDs, and gnomAD allele frequencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/clingen_ar_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/clingen_ar_tools.rst:65
#: 465bac9ee0e940138831e2c9ce488970 fd53e969ab444c3d844206a5688ea416
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/clingen_ar_tools.rst:36 1e58a658835c4008a9c76fc282abcd71
msgid ""
"``allele_id`` (string) (required) ClinGen canonical allele ID. Examples: "
"'CA000387' (TP53 R248Q), 'CA006116' (BRCA1 variant). Use "
"ClinGenAR\\_lookup\\_allele first to get the CA ID."
msgstr ""

